# D-12: the old .gitignore blanket-ignored *.json, *.csv, *.xml, database/,
# which would have silently untracked the GeoJSON navmesh, MOTChallenge
# ground truth, and scenario definitions. Explicit negations below keep
# those tracked.
!configs/**
!scenarios/**
!data/floorplan/**
!data/gt/**

# WP-04: node keypairs (starling_net.keys) are generated per-deployment via
# `python -m starling_net.keys --generate N`, never committed — this
# re-excludes them even though the negation above un-ignores configs/**.
configs/keys/
